(4, 1, 'assistant', 'I\'m unable to create tables, but I can certainly list the services provided by VR Consulting in a clear format. Here are the services:\n\n**Services Offered by VR Consulting:**\n\n- **Website Development:** Creating responsive and user-friendly websites.\n  \n- **Mobile Applications:** Development of apps for Android and iOS platforms.\n  \n- **Software Products:** Tailored software solutions to meet specific business needs.\n  \n- **Customer Relationship Management (CRM):** Systems to manage interactions with clients and enhance relationships.\n\n- **Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP):** Integrated management of core business processes.\n  \n- **Multi-Level Marketing (MLM):** Systems designed to support MLM business models.\n  \n- **Digital Marketing:** Comprehensive marketing strategies for online presence and engagement.\n  \nFeel free to ask if you need more detailed information on any specific service!', 'msg_tDUjBG6hVBOsEeBD8cGlHQvI', '2026-06-19 07:41:52', '2026-06-19 07:41:52'),
(5, 2, 'user', 'hii', 'msg_JWRO469StkIkNYvkUIVAn34p', '2026-06-19 13:21:48', '2026-06-19 13:21:48'),
(6, 2, 'assistant', 'Hi 👋 Welcome to VR Consulting. How can I help you today?', 'msg_jcPJgpWlb97tweSkDf8Dx1UT', '2026-06-19 13:21:54', '2026-06-19 13:21:54'),
(7, 2, 'user', 'i am looking for agency while maintaince my website', 'msg_A6Uk97wYeDgy1qnGZzVLgSAY', '2026-06-19 13:24:16', '2026-06-19 13:24:16'),
(8, 2, 'assistant', 'VR Consulting offers comprehensive **website maintenance services** to help ensure your website runs smoothly and remains up to date. Here are some key features of their services:\n\n- **Bug Free Code:** Focus on clean, optimized, and reliable code.\n- **Premier Support:** Dedicated technical support with quick issue resolution.\n- **Modern Development:** Utilization of the latest technologies for scalable solutions.\n- **Experienced Team:** Professional project managers, developers, designers, and QA specialists.\n- **Customer Focused:** Solutions tailored to meet client requirements.\n\nYou can get in touch with them to learn more about their website maintenance services. \n\nIf you need more information or want to contact them, here are the details:\n\n- **Phone:** +91 7982616770\n- **Email:** info@vrwebconsulting.com\n- **Website:** [VR Consulting](https://vrwebconsulting.com) . \n\nLet me know if you need anything else!', 'msg_b6gLkeNTTSpcftLDv74e2kZ0', '2026-06-19 13:24:27', '2026-06-19 13:24:27'),
(9, 2, 'user', 'how can i maintain my website in less amount of money', 'msg_mI21N8efng51qauioj1NBsfp', '2026-06-19 13:26:43', '2026-06-19 13:26:43'),
(10, 2, 'assistant', 'To maintain your website on a budget, consider the following tips:\n\n- **DIY Maintenance:** Learn basic website management skills to handle small updates yourself.\n- **Use Budget-Friendly Hosting:** Choose a reliable yet affordable hosting provider for your site.\n- **Limit Plugin Usage:** Use only essential plugins and keep them updated to avoid security issues.\n- **Regular Backups:** Schedule regular backups using automated tools to prevent data loss.\n- **Optimize Performance:** Implement caching and optimize images to improve website speed, which can reduce potential issues.\n- **Security Measures:** Use basic security measures like SSL certificates and regular updates to protect your site without incurring high costs.\n\nThese strategies can help you maintain your website effectively while keeping costs low. \n\nIf you have more specific needs or questions, feel free to ask!', 'msg_fJyCHpCNiMPTPswZ0cfxOaz1', '2026-06-19 13:26:52', '2026-06-19 13:26:52'),
(11, 2, 'user', 'does vrc done job portal projects', 'msg_cVGJYYqxPOjs7sQC4RSmu7Eh', '2026-06-19 13:28:14', '2026-06-19 13:28:14'),
(12, 2, 'assistant', 'Yes, VR Consulting develops complete job portal solutions tailored for recruitment agencies, companies, educational institutions, and startups. Their job portal services include features such as:\n\n- **For Job Seekers:** \n  - Job search\n  - Resume upload\n  - One click apply\n  - Job alerts and job tracking\n\n- **For Employers:** \n  - Job posting\n  - Applicant tracking\n  - Candidate management\n  - Employer dashboard\n\n- **Admin Features:** \n  - User management\n  - Subscription management\n  - Reports & analytics\n\nIf you\'re interested in more details or specific features, feel free to ask!', 'msg_572mK67htEGR26jJ2VDsNq66', '2026-06-19 13:28:22', '2026-06-19 13:28:22'),
