(28, 6, 'assistant', '**Web Design Services by VR Consulting**\n\nVR Consulting specializes in delivering high-quality web design and development services tailored to meet the unique needs of businesses. Here’s an overview of what we offer:\n\n- **Website Development**\n- **PHP Web Application Development**\n- **E-Commerce Website Development**\n- **CMS Development**\n- **UI/UX Design**\n- **Mobile Application Development**\n- **Digital Marketing and SEO Services**\n\n**Our Approach:**\n- We emphasize clean, optimized, and reliable code with a focus on quality.\n- Our team consists of experienced project managers, developers, designers, and QA specialists who ensure timely delivery and customer satisfaction.\n\nFor more details, you can visit our [website](https://vrwebconsulting.com) or contact us at:\n- **Phone:** +91 7982616770\n- **Email:** info@vrwebconsulting.com\n\nIf you\'re interested in exploring our portfolio, we have successfully completed over 120 projects and maintain a client rating of 4.8/5. \n\nLet me know if you have any specific questions or need further information! 😊', 'msg_3wUk5KrCzj8Tmz2oU5LHIeMR', '2026-07-01 06:57:05', '2026-07-01 06:57:05'),
