(32, 7, 'assistant', 'Currently, I don\'t have specific PHP job openings listed at VR Consulting. However, VR Consulting specializes in PHP web application development, and they often look for skilled professionals in this area.\n\nIf you\'re interested, you can check out their job portal for any updates or new listings related to PHP positions. For further inquiries or assistance, you may contact them directly at:\n\n- **Phone**: +91 7982616770\n- **Email**: info@vrwebconsulting.com\n\nFeel free to ask if there\'s anything else you\'d like to know!', 'msg_BTQVFXJ9H3TPm4xQ4abtUnKi', '2026-07-01 09:57:23', '2026-07-01 09:57:23'),
