(36, 8, 'assistant', 'VR Consulting offers **Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)** solutions that help businesses manage their operations efficiently. Their ERP services include:\n\n- **Custom ERP Solutions:** Tailored to meet the unique needs of various industries.\n- **Streamlined Operations:** Integration of core business processes into one system.\n- **Scalability:** Designed to grow with your business.\n- **Comprehensive Reporting:** Real-time insights and analytics for informed decision-making.\n- **User-Friendly Interface:** Easy-to-use systems for better adoption across all user levels.\n\nIf you have specific questions or need more information about ERP services, let me know!', 'msg_JK4P4vVzMU4K2sScUrl6Ma4V', '2026-07-16 08:02:56', '2026-07-16 08:02:56'),
