(122, '', 'Android Application', 'android-app-development-company', 'Best Android Application Development Company in India', '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br />We are master in developing custom mobile apps for all platforms of Android to the new Windows mobile platform. Our expert team of android app developers having excellent knowledge of recent platform like 2.0, 2.1 SDK, 2.2, 2.3 and 4.0.We have well performing workforce of developers and designers who works together for custom Android app development. Our Android expert team is always sensible with latest changes in Android app platform. Our leading teams enable to create any Android app colourable, state of the art design and have deep knowledge of techniques. Our experts are all highly skillful with the Android SKD and they can make apps for both older and new Android versions. Our marketing team continuous inform to our designer and developers regarding client requirement thus we can created user oriented apps. We never force any client to develop an application strictly for one platform only.<br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Our professional staff has ability to know the client requirement thus we can get top volume of satisfied client in the Indian market. Our developers firstly know client</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> need and suggest the best app and then at last moment they develop application. Thus we can win large volume of satisfied client among the competitors.</span></p>\r\n<br /><br />\r\n<div class=\"full-width-banner\" style=\"background: url(\'images/about-us.png\'); background-attachment: fixed; padding: 100px 0px;\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<h4 class=\" pb-3 white\">Android app developers from us and get<br /> the following Android Application Development Services:</h4>\r\n<br /><br />\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 hero-left\">\r\n<ul class=\"white\">\r\n<li>Android Games Application Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Games Application Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Multimedia Apps Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Mobile Application Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Web Apps Development Services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 hero-left\">\r\n<ul class=\"white\">\r\n<li>Android SDK Application Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Business Apps Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Custom Android Application Development Services</li>\r\n<li>Android Banking Apps Development Services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Android Application Development Company in India - VR Consulting', 'VR Consulting - Leading Android app development company in Delhi, India pioneer to design the best Android applications for mobile devices at affordable price.', 'Android App Development Company,Android App Development', 0, 2848, '2016-02-21 16:31:21', '2020-07-14 06:20:50', 1, 0),
(123, '', 'Custom Software Development', 'custom-software-development', 'Custom Software Development', '<p>Custom software Application Development is get going for designing software that has been designed and programmed for a specific need. While all application development outsourcing is technically modify, the difference is that packaged applications we are designed with a general set of characteristics to be used by a broad range of visitors. Custom application development is capable of producing practically any feature you may requirement for your site. Time and money are virtually the only limiting reason.</p>\r\n<p>Perfection planning and design is the key to successful Custom application development. It can give your site unique and precious features, but make sure the return is worth the cost. &nbsp;VR Consulting offers an opportunity to develop a competitive advantage by using technology in a more productive and effective way than your competitors. It does not have to be expensive. This tool can become an efficient method for both industry leaders and large companies to reduce expenses and retain a competitive profit.</p>\r\n<p>Our Software Development Team provides total flexibility in terms of custom software development &ndash; the process is essentially Client Driven. It is important to remember that a well-designed database should provide the end product that is stiff to meet both your professional and practical business sure and therefore serve its intended intention.</p>\r\n<p>The Custom software Development process normally includes, but is not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Analysis of the business needs,</li>\r\n<li>Enterprise of design specifications</li>\r\n<li>design concept</li>\r\n<li>Programming</li>\r\n<li>Testing/validation</li>\r\n<li>support (Training &amp; support material)</li>\r\n<li>Development and maintenance</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Custom Software Development company |  VR Consulting', 'Custom Software Development services From  VR Consulting | Fast Growing Software Development company in Nepal with experience in Cutting Edge Technologies.', 'custom software development, custom software development services, custom software development company', 0, 1669, '2016-02-21 16:46:41', '2019-04-23 10:25:55', 1, 0),
(124, '', 'Third Party API Integration', 'third-party-api-integration', 'Third Party API Integration', '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Third Party API integration helps you integrate data with third party applications. VR Consulting&nbsp; can also enjoy data from a wide range of third party sources. In addition to different domains such as shipping, payment, travel and social media, lot of experience working with demand side stage that integrate popular online advertising network APIs including Google Ad Words and Bing Ads.\r\n<h2>Our Services</h2>\r\n<p>Our API integration services include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Demand side platforms that integrate with online advertising networks such as Google Ad Words and Bing Ads</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Social media API such as Twitter, Facebook, Google +, LinkedIn, Pinterest, instagram</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Facebook applications</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Google APIs including Maps, Analytics, YouTube, Charts and Search, google captcha</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">SMS gateway integration</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Travel APIs such as Expedia and Amadeus</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Payment gateway integration such as PayPal, Direct Debit, Authorize.net</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shipping API integration services such as FedEx, UPS, US Postal Service</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>The Benefit to Clients</h2>\r\n<p>From home that centralizes data from several sources to leveraging third party applications, we offer you a wide range of API integration services. Our experience with APIs across domains helps ensure the design and delivery of the most solutions that support your business requirement. To find out how we can help your business leverage third party APIs, discuss your requirements with our respected team today.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>', 'Third Party API Integration | VR CONSULTING', 'VRC is a leading third party API integration service provider in India. API such as Twitter, Facebook, Google +, LinkedIn, Pinterest, instagram etc.', 'API integration service in India, API integration service, third party API integration, travel API integration, shipping API integration,', 0, 1740, '2016-02-21 17:04:39', '2019-05-27 07:24:43', 1, 0),
(125, '', 'Software Development Services List', 'software-development-services-list', 'Software Development Services List', '<p><strong>We provide given services from Nepal </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>PHP website development</li>\r\n<li>Laravel website development</li>\r\n<li>Phalcon website development</li>\r\n<li>Symfony website development</li>\r\n<li>Yii Framework website development</li>\r\n<li>Codeigniter website development</li>\r\n<li>CakePHP website development</li>\r\n<li>Zend website development</li>\r\n<li>WordPress website development</li>\r\n<li>Joomla Website development</li>\r\n<li>ASP. NET website development</li>\r\n<li>ASP. NET application software development</li>\r\n<li>SharePoint website development</li>\r\n<li>Drupal website development</li>\r\n<li>Custom Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Website Design &amp; Development</li>\r\n<li>Android Application Development</li>\r\n<li>iPhone Application Development</li>\r\n<li>iPad Application Development</li>\r\n<li>BlackBerry Application Development</li>\r\n<li>Windows Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li>Accounting Software Product</li>\r\n<li>Payroll Software Product</li>\r\n<li>Pharmacy Management Software Product</li>\r\n<li>Hospital Management Software Product</li>\r\n<li>Restaurant Management Software Product</li>\r\n<li>CRM Software Product</li>\r\n<li>ERP Software Product</li>\r\n</ul>', 'NPW Services Lists | Nepal', 'List of our Services are PHP,Phalcon,Yii Framework,Codeigniter,CakePHP,Zend,WordPress,Joomla,ASP. NET,Drupal,Android,iPhone,iPad development from Nepal', 'PHP website development ,Laravel website development ,Phalcon website development ,Symfony website development ,Yii Framework website development ,Codeigniter ,development ,CakePHP website development ,Zend website development ,WordPress website', 0, 2, '2016-02-27 10:12:24', '2016-02-27 04:42:24', 1, 1),
(126, '', 'Payment Gateway', 'payment-gateway', 'Payment Getaway', '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img src=\"https://vrwebconsulting.com/uploads/files/8632135298.jpg\" alt=\"payment gatway\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" /><br />A means of permit credit card or other forms of electronic payments. These E payments can be made offline or online via a website or at an actual snag and pounder retail foundation. Payment gateways help to protect sensitive information like credit card numbers and other account information by encrypting the data they transmit to merchants and payment processors.<br /></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Payment Gateways are software API that transmit Transaction info to proceeds Banks and responses from issuing banks. Really, Payment Gateways facilitate communication within banks.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Security is an integral factor of all payment gateways, as sensitive data such as Credit Card Numbers need to be safed from any fraudulent parties. The card associations have created a set of rules and security standards which must be followed by anyone with reach to card information including gateways. This set of rules and security standards is called the Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard.<br /><br /><strong><a id=\"payprocess\"></a>Payment Processing</strong><br /></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Submitting an order is usually completed using HTTPS protocol, which securely inform personal info through the parties rolled in the Transaction. Many Payment Providers, such as 2Checkout, enable Merchants with added options when a cardholder purchases a service and product. Aside from providing the strength for real-time transactions, these providers can help to translate currencies between two sides in different countries, as well as bridge language and payment methods. Payment gateways usually charge those who use them a per transaction fee.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></div>', 'Payment Getaway |VR Consulting', 'VR Consulting provide best payment getaway integration services based in India like PayPal API,  Google Checkout API, Web API Service etc', 'Payment Getaway api integration in india', 0, 2093, '2016-02-27 11:18:20', '2019-06-07 13:13:31', 1, 0),
(127, '', 'IOS App Development Company', 'ios-app-development-company', 'Best IOS App Development Company in India', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://vrwebconsulting.com/uploads/files/9958938237.jpg\" alt=\"ios \" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" /><br />Having successfully delivered and designed lots of IOS App Projects, we are amongst the leading application development companies in India. Our team is excellent in developing and designing Application for iPhone , iPhone 5, iPhone 5s, 4, iPhone 4s, iPhone 5c, iPhone 6 and iPhone 6 Plus. We have also optimized several apps for IOS 7, IOS 8 and IOS 9 Beta 2.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why VR consulting as an IOS App Development Company?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Our development community of skilled IOS experts will partner with you to develop your idea into feature-rich apps for iPhones. Our excelent designers focus on making the application interactive and ensure top user engagement with intuitive user interface.</p>\r\n<p><strong>IOS&nbsp; App Development Services:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>IOS&nbsp; Aggregator Application Development</li>\r\n<li>IOS&nbsp; Game Development</li>\r\n<li>IOS&nbsp; Apps Testing / Portability</li>\r\n<li>IOS&nbsp; E-commerce Application Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our&nbsp;IOS&nbsp; app development&nbsp;expert is capable, skilled and equipped to transform your application idea into a reality.</p>', 'Ios Application Development Company in India - VR Consulting', 'VR Consulting - One of the best Ios app development services company in India who has a well-experienced team of developers to design quality applications for their users.', 'Ios App Development Company In Delhi,Ios App Development Company,Ios App Development', 0, 2385, '2016-02-27 11:56:46', '2019-06-26 08:15:57', 1, 0),
