(842, '', 'PHP Programming', 'php-programming', 'PHP Programming', '<p>PHP is a server scripting language, and a great&nbsp;tool for making movable and interactive Web sites.</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>PHP is the world\'s popular, general-purpose, open-source scripting language and MySQL is the world&rsquo;s popular open-source database. Specialized in providing able and affordable MySQL/ PHP services that would include oblation our customers with dynamic web application and web portals for business purposes. We have long experience in MySQL/ PHP development and a good knowledge of the complete PHP framework. Customization PHP development is cognition of our company and our expert PHP teams. We &nbsp;offering PHP Development Services like:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Blogs</li>\r\n<li>Mailing System</li>\r\n<li>Mobile development</li>\r\n<li>Forums</li>\r\n<li>Banner and Advertising</li>\r\n<li>Message boards</li>\r\n<li>HTML5 &amp; CSS3 Support</li>\r\n<li>Web content management</li>\r\n<li>CakePHP development</li>\r\n<li>PHPBB</li>\r\n<li>OsTicket Integration</li>\r\n<li>Custom theme integration</li>\r\n<li>PHP Smarty development</li>\r\n<li>PHP Developers Nepal</li>\r\n<li>CRM application development</li>\r\n<li>Database driven application development</li>\r\n<li>Multilanguage Support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', 'PHP Programming | VR Consulting', 'PHP Programming in Noida,Delhi, Expert PHP Development Service. We offer Hire PHP developers India, PHP development and theme customization', 'PHP Programming in Noida,Delhi,India', 0, 949, '2016-09-09 15:07:14', '2019-04-23 10:10:56', 1, 0),
(843, '', 'Laravel Web Application Development', 'laravel-web-application-development', 'Laravel Web Application Development', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"uploads/files/2932009306.jpg\" alt=\"larawell\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" /><br />We are a leading Laravel development company in india. Our team of experts builds great Web apps by using the laravel PHP framework. Laravel Application Development is the famous PHP framework, which is in demand by client of all sorts. Laravel provides best development speed with extension ability, which makes it attractive for development of web apps. The laravel development services are based on different fronts from laravel web development, laravel customization, extension development and integration, laravel restful application, website migration using laravel to laravel extension development.&nbsp;<br /> <br />VR Consulting&nbsp;specializes in laravel application development, E-Commerce development, laravel custom development, laravel package development, SaaS app development. Our team of laravel developers has been using different programming frameworks for various Customers, which made them high able to handle custom Laravel requests. There are number of merits that Laravel framework carries from good bundle use, class auto loading, restful resource controllers, &nbsp;powerful and brilliant accessibility, eloquent ORM, reverse routing, meaningful migration system, automatic pagination to unit testing, IoC container that detect and prevent regressions. We provide our customers with the best Laravel framework for their business. We have a team of highly brilliant laravel developers who work smartly for every project in order to make it a success.</p>', 'Laravel Web Application Development Company india', 'VR Consulting has been providing laravel web application development services in INdia since 2015. Contact for more about laravel software development', 'laravel application development company in India, laravel development services In India,  laravel web application development, laravel developers India', 0, 1063, '2016-09-09 15:35:38', '2019-07-04 06:58:22', 1, 0),
(844, '', 'Creative Web Design Development', 'creative-web-design-development', 'Creative Web Design Development', '<h4><strong>Code expertise and pleasant web designs!</strong></h4>\r\n<p>For those who have been beating under the tick and never took a dip into the capacity of a page; the summary of web designing goes beyond only embedding pleasing layouts with the development code. It can make or crack a business.&nbsp;In this age when hundreds of websites are boast in the huge ocean of web, a client will stop at a design that has an arresting face. A exclusive web design lays the base foundation for an effective information in the real world. <br /><br />We at&nbsp;VR CONSULTING are a proficient team of web designers with high experience in developing graceful website designs to secure an attested web diagram. Our law so far has encouraged us to raise our creative formula and mix it with profitable marketing returns.&nbsp;<br /><br />Our team has so far bidden vale to the ancient designing techniques and have pay up the trending action such as the scroll down effect that present a hanging effect when stopped. Believe us, instant texts or splash effects are no more grave. We have the ability to offer much more. <br /><br />Get web existence is a job half done unless you get app existence. After a long discussion of \'no or yes\', application have finally collected a terrible response amongst palce worldwide. Believe it or not but they are more effective in geting your company economic business than the lineal websites. We had searched their capacity omni earlier and have been designing websites to make them application friendly.</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\"><strong>Did you heard&nbsp;about the responsive web design?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Web designing course will register the start of responsive designs as a mark bounce. Responsive designs add to user interaction in a gorgeous way. They help small screens as well and carry the nature of your brand\'s message effectively. A responsive web design removes the need to develop a separate website for mob screens. At VR CONSULTING, we addition all design aesthetics to offer a visual request for the clients.<br /><br /><strong>WEBSITE DESIGN SERVICES WE COVER</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>User interface design</li>\r\n<li>Site Layout design</li>\r\n<li>Site Re-design</li>\r\n<li>Site flow and navigation</li>\r\n<li>HTML integration with back-end technologies</li>\r\n<li>Logo designing</li>\r\n<li>Ad Banners</li>\r\n<li>Promotional Newsletters</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Professional Creative Website Design, Development | VR', 'VR CONSULTING is a Professional Creative Website Design & Development Company in Noida,India since 2016. We are all type of web solution', 'Php Developers, Web Developers, Designers, Website Development Outsourcing Company Noida,lndia, Website Design and Development Company, Offshore Website Designing Outsourcing Company,', 0, 4, '2016-09-19 17:48:06', '2019-04-19 11:06:57', 1, 0),
(845, '', 'Content Management Systems', 'content-management-systems', 'Content Management Systems', 'VR CONSULTING&nbsp;has in-depth knowledge&nbsp;in developing and design&nbsp;Web Content Management Solutions. Be it a qualified&nbsp;interactive custom code&nbsp;CMS for a reputed&nbsp;website; a simple and seo-friendly CMS for self-managed website; or an enterprise vast&nbsp;content management system, our content management contribution&nbsp;cover solutions and services&nbsp;for each needs.\r\n<h2 class=\"title-header\">Our Services</h2>\r\n<p>Our CMS solutions include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Access control</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic template integrations</li>\r\n<li>Document &amp; File Management</li>\r\n<li>Content maintenance features</li>\r\n<li>Rich media management</li>\r\n<li>Internationalization and Localization</li>\r\n<li>Social media integration</li>\r\n<li>Content collaboration</li>\r\n<li>Content aggregation</li>\r\n<li>Content syndication</li>\r\n<li>Content versioning</li>\r\n<li>Accessibility features</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"title-header\">Technologies &amp;&nbsp;Platforms</h2>\r\n<p>VR CONSULTING&nbsp;has opened&nbsp;large scale Enterprise CMS&nbsp;using:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Microsoft Office Sharepoint Server</li>\r\n<li>Liferay Portal</li>\r\n<li>SiteCore</li>\r\n<li>Acquia</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>We also have comprehensive&nbsp;experience developing dynamic web CMS&nbsp;over:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Drupal</li>\r\n<li>dotCMS</li>\r\n<li>DotNetNuke</li>\r\n<li>Wordpress</li>\r\n<li>OpenCMS</li>\r\n<li>Joomla</li>\r\n<li>Expression Engine</li>\r\n<li>Typo3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"title-header\">The Benefit to Clients</h2>\r\n<p>Through the CM&nbsp;practice,&nbsp;VR CONSULTING creates enterprise grade web CM&nbsp;solutions and deploys them as High&nbsp;scale platforms for a broad&nbsp;range of industries. Enterprises need dynamic characteristics&nbsp;that allow for content authoring, editing and approval workflows. With the CMS&nbsp;we deploy, we ensure that businesses can deliver formally curated content with all checks and balances in place. In addition to facilitate&nbsp;content concentricity, participation&nbsp;and syndication, our solutions also constituted&nbsp;version control, which helps editors easily revert to any previously saved versions.</p>', 'CMS Design & Development in Nepal | VR CONSULTING', 'VR CONSULTING Professionals will create and design customized content management system(CMS) as per client, business requirements in Noida,India', 'CMS services,Content management system,Customized CMS,CMS solutions,content management services', 0, 2, '2016-09-21 17:07:58', '2019-04-27 07:55:11', 1, 0),
(846, '', 'government website development company in india', 'government-website-development-company-in-India', 'Government Website Development Company in india', 'VR CONSULTING&nbsp;is develop and design of government of India website, web applications and custom software as per government&nbsp;requirement.<br /><br />A website impersonate a picture of the success of the government department, a beautifully designed, educative website indicates about the awareness and activeness of government officials in IT services.<br />\r\n<p>We at&nbsp;India Web services&nbsp;have been working with government since 2016, we have worked for Government offices of India. Working for government is an deferential job for us, we carry out our work with utmost concerns and care.</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>We know all the formalities involved in serving at different government officials, we have never been penalized or blacklisted for failing of performance or services . We hold well&nbsp;records at government levels.</p>\r\n<p>We have experience in developing web&nbsp;portal, website, web applications&nbsp;for government departments, updating government websites and maintaining websites on a regular basis, uploading contents, public notices and other documents for public use.</p>\r\n<p>If your department is looking forward to hire a reputed, trusted and honest website design company, which has experiences in serving government officers with due diligence, we would request you to kindly contact us for your requirements.</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>', 'Government Website development Company | VR CONSULTING', 'VR CONSULTING Company provides website, web application, web portal, custom software design and development for government of India', 'Government Website development Company, Government Web application development, Government Web portal development', 0, 1, '2016-09-22 13:59:16', '2019-04-27 08:00:50', 1, 0),
(847, '', 'AngularJS Web Application Development', 'angularjs-web-application-development', 'Best Angularjs Web Application Development Services Company in India', '<div>AngularJS is a Java base framework by Google which is primarily used for developing Web applications. It has a Fame of being among the most flexible full featured languages in the world. It has among the most facile MVC implementation.</div>\r\n<div>At&nbsp;VR CONSULTING we have hands-on experience of using AngularJS for web applications.<br />We have been actively promoting benefits of the same to our clients&nbsp;so it can provide an overall value to their technologes.&nbsp;VR CONSULTING is among the leading web based development company in Noida, Delhi,india who have adopted AngularJS right since 2016. Our in house developers are expert into AngularJS2 development and building tailor made applications. We believe in adopting technology ahead of time so we can pass on the benefits to our clients&nbsp;thereby enabling their business to be more competitive.<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div class=\"full-width-banner\" style=\"background: url(\'images/about-us.png\'); background-attachment: fixed; padding: 100px 0px;\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 hero-left\">\r\n<h4 class=\" pb-3\">Some of the benefits which&nbsp;VR CONSULTING has observed in AngularJS are:</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"white\">\r\n<li>Simplified MVC Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Provides Two way Data Binding</li>\r\n<li>Allows Developers to Express UI Declaratively</li>\r\n<li>Provides Ideal Architectural Approach for your Software</li>\r\n<li>Reusable HTML Components</li>\r\n<li>Emrabces Test Drive Development Approach</li>\r\n<li>Supports Single Page Applications</li>\r\n<li>Enables Parallel Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 hero-left\">\r\n<h4 class=\" pb-3\">Our AngularJS Development services include:</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"white\">\r\n<li>Internet Rich Application Development</li>\r\n<li>Responsive Website Development</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Web Application Development</li>\r\n<li>Custom Widget Development</li>\r\n<li>Hire AngularJS Developer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Angularjs Web Application Development Company in India', 'VR Consulting is one of the best AngularJS web application development service company in India offers the best and cheapest MVC implementation. Visit us now!', 'Angularjs Web Application Development,Angularjs Web Application', 0, 2462, '2017-02-23 23:53:54', '2020-07-14 06:10:17', 1, 0),
